        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9030, Decorative Beaded Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable with a 3-1/2 inch, 5 inch, and a 7 inch center to center, the Beaded Cabinet Pull made by Omnia is exemplary of the quality and beauty for which Omnia is known. The beaded middle, though subtle, has a timelessness that will be sure to bring elegance to your kitchen cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/traditional-beaded-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9030\"><b>Beaded Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Beaded Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9030/89</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 15/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9030/128</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 17/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9030/178</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed this in a larger size? <a href=\"/products/traditional-beaded-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9030\"><b>click here</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lion-head-door-stop.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
